       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLER IS INITIAL PROGRAM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      /
       01 W-PARMS.
          05 SOCK-THREAD        PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
          05 W-DATA             PIC X(40).
          05 OPERATION          PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
             88 OP-SEND                    VALUE 1000.
             88 OP-RECEIVE                 VALUE 1001.
             88 OP-BUILD-LISTENER          VALUE 1002.
             88 OP-BUILD-SOCKET            VALUE 1003.
             88 OP-FLUSH-SOCKET            VALUE 1004.
             88 OP-CLOSE-SOCKET            VALUE 1005.
             88 OP-CRSR-CLRHOME            VALUE 147.
             88 OP-CRSR-HOME               VALUE 83.
             88 OP-CRSR-RVSON              VALUE 18.
             88 OP-CRSR-RVSOFF             VALUE 146.
             88 OP-CRSR-LEFT               VALUE 157.
             88 OP-CRSR-RIGHT              VALUE 93.
             88 OP-CRSR-UP                 VALUE 145.
             88 OP-CRSR-DOWN               VALUE 17.
             88 OP-CRSR-BLACK              VALUE 144.
             88 OP-CRSR-WHITE              VALUE 5.
             88 OP-CRSR-RED                VALUE 28.
             88 OP-CRSR-CYAN               VALUE 159.
             88 OP-CRSR-PURPLE             VALUE 156.
             88 OP-CRSR-GREEN              VALUE 30.
             88 OP-CRSR-BLUE               VALUE 31.
             88 OP-CRSR-YELLOW             VALUE 158.
             88 OP-CRSR-ORANGE             VALUE 129.
             88 OP-CRSR-BROWN              VALUE 149.
             88 OP-CRSR-PINK               VALUE 150.
             88 OP-CRSR-DARKGREY           VALUE 151.
             88 OP-CRSR-GREY               VALUE 152.
             88 OP-CRSR-LIGHTGREEN         VALUE 153.
             88 OP-CRSR-LIGHTBLUE          VALUE 154.
             88 OP-CRSR-LIGHTGREY          VALUE 155.
             88 OP-CRLF                    VALUE 1310.
      / 
      /
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      /*---------------------------------------------------------------*
       MAIN-LOGIC.
            DISPLAY 'DEBUG> MAIN-LOGIC'

            SET OP-BUILD-LISTENER TO TRUE
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS
            
            SET OP-BUILD-SOCKET   TO TRUE
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS
            
            SET OP-CRSR-CLRHOME   TO TRUE
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            SET OP-SEND           TO TRUE
            MOVE 'WELCOME TO igp test bbs IN cobol' TO W-DATA
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            SET OP-CRSR-YELLOW   TO TRUE
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            SET OP-SEND           TO TRUE
            MOVE 'ANOTHER TEXT IN YELLOW' TO W-DATA
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            SET OP-CRLF           TO TRUE
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            SET OP-CRSR-LIGHTBLUW TO TRUE
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            SET OP-SEND           TO TRUE
            MOVE 'a package to build your bbs in cobol' TO W-DATA
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            SET OP-FLUSH-SOCKET   TO TRUE
            CALL "WSERV" USING W-PARMS

            ACCEPT OMITTED
            STOP RUN
            .
